classDiagram
    class SyncController {
        +syncPendingRecords() SyncResult
        +syncRecord(UUID localId) SyncStatus
    }

    class SyncService {
        +syncPendingRecords() SyncResult
        +syncRecord(SyncRecord record) SyncStatus
        -markAsSynced(UUID localId) void
        -markAsConflict(UUID localId) void
    }

    class SyncStrategy {
        <<interface>>
        +resolve(SyncRecord local, ServerRecord server) ConflictResult
    }

    class ManualConflictStrategy {
        +resolve(SyncRecord local, ServerRecord server) ConflictResult
    }

    class SyncRepository {
        <<interface>>
        +findPending() List~SyncRecord~
        +markSynced(UUID localId) void
        +markConflict(UUID localId) void
    }

    class SyncRecord {
        -UUID localId
        -String entityType
        -String payload
        -SyncStatus status
        -Instant createdAt
        +markSynced() void
        +markConflict() void
    }

    class ApiClient {
        +send(SyncRecord record) SyncResponse
    }

    SyncController --> SyncService : invoca
    SyncService --> SyncRepository : consulta cola
    SyncService --> ApiClient : envía cambios
    SyncService --> SyncStrategy : resuelve conflicto
    SyncStrategy <|.. ManualConflictStrategy
    SyncRepository --> SyncRecord : administra